[Options]

[A.]
<p>This is here for you people who are too lazy, or perhaps simply can't get past certain missions or whatever.
<p>At any rate this is here so you can bascially unlock and give yourself access to all the maps.
<p>This was more or less a last minute addition, so use it at your own risk.
<?{atcampaign1}>$Menu=~wThe Dark Lords,Tell,C1 </?>
<?{atcampaign2}>$Menu=~wNew Ruler of Nimbus,Tell,C2 </?>
